title: Renaissance — full-forest captain board (governance T-009)
summary: 'Fixed a real visibility gap caught while populating the board: the captain board was run-centric (orchestration epics + children + ripple-ranked unclaimed), so claimed STANDALONE tasks — like the governance backlog claimed to cid/forge/compliance — were invisible on the board (in neither runs nor unclaimed). The swim-lanes literally couldn''t show claimed work. Added a `loose` category to assembleCaptainBoard (non-terminal roots that aren''t a run or unclaimed = claimed standalone + in-progress unclaimed standalone), enriched with estimate+taskType, rendered as claimant lanes by BoardView. Verified live: loose now shows forge:4/cid:4/compliance:1/human:2. This is Cid''s ''see the whole forest'' protocol made real. Build green, CLI 441 / MCP 445.'
