  - packages/paradigm/src/platform-server/routes/tasks.ts
  - packages/paradigm/platform-ui/src/sections/tasks/components/BoardView.tsx
  - packages/paradigm/platform-ui/src/sections/tasks/store/tasksStore.ts
  - CHANGELOG.md
learnings:
  - 'The ''board populated'' claim from the prior round was FALSE in a way only direct verification caught: I checked claimant distribution via the LIST endpoint, but BoardView renders from the BOARD endpoint, which excluded claimed-standalone tasks entirely. Verify the EXACT data path the UI consumes, not an adjacent endpoint that happens to have the data.'
  - 'The run-centric board model (epics + children + unclaimed) had a silent third category it never represented: claimed roots with no orchestration parent. The governance protocol (''see the whole forest'') predicted exactly this gap before the code did — the notebook protocol was a real spec, not a platitude.'
